Package: sleepermetrics
Title: Analytical Metrics for Sleeper Fantasy Football Leagues
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alexander", "Yeh", email = "alexander.x.yeh@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fetches public Sleeper fantasy football league data by league id,
    walks the multi-season chain, and computes descriptive analytics
    (standings, all-play luck, lineup efficiency, consistency, points
    for/against, career trajectories and manager-player loyalty) with
    ready-made 'ggplot2' charts and auto-generated markdown insight summaries.
    A bundled 'shiny' dashboard visualises any league id interactively.
    Generalised from the DDBM league project; the optimal-lineup solver adapts
    to each league's roster settings.
